    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, our firm is looking to move away from SMS-based MFA because of the interception risks. can u give me a high level breakdown of what the implementation process looks like if we switch to hardware security keys like yubikeys instead? basically just the stages of deployment for a law firm environment.",
