      "content": "The implementation begins with a security audit to identify sensitive data and select a compliant hardware key provider suitable for legal regulations. Once chosen, you must distribute physical keys to authorized personnel and integrate them with your Identity Provider (IdP) to update authentication configurations. Following the technical setup, a comprehensive user acceptance and training phase ensures staff can securely use the devices, often supplemented by a soft launch pilot. Finally, you conduct a monitoring review of login logs to verify success rates and elimination of SMS interception risks before formally closing the deployment project. This phased approach minimizes operational disruption while significantly hardening your firm's authentication posture.",
